WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:09,020
Huh, Ahiba, why don't you bite a hole and touch it?

2
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:22,110
Have they returned to reality?

3
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:26,690
The game is over, the rewards have been obtained, and when you step out, you will go home!

4
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:28,390
This is not necessarily the case

5
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:32,670
If you don't leave, will you stay here and starve to death? This door will be closed soon!
